<title>UK: Statoil sets 200 mln Sfr five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Statoil sets 200 mln Sfr five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATOIL</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    25.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.15     PAY DATE    25.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5	   EOS	   18.SEP.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
